{"product_id":"vaporesso-eco-nano-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Eco Nano Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso Eco Nano Pod System, offering a 1000mAh battery, 6mL capacity pod, and delivers exceptional flavor in a diminutive size.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from lightweight zinc alloy, the Vaporesso Eco Nano chassis fits squarely within the palm of the hand, making for easy transportation and storage. Equipped with a large 1000mAh battery, the Eco Nano Pod Kit will faithfully serve throughout the day, pumping out clouds of flavor-laden vapor to tantalize the taste buds. With a sleek and uninterrupted chassis design, the Eco Nano does not possess any buttons or screens, allowing the battery to focus solely on delivering outstanding flavor from the 6mL refillable pod. Adopting an integrated coil design, Vaporesso has eliminated the need for replacing coils, making the Eco Nano a mess-free affair, perfect novices or those on-the-go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso Eco Nano Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 76.7mm by 45mm by 18.2mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc Alloy OR ABS Material\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: XROS Eco Nano Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Bottom Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil: Integrated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Eco Nano\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Eco Nano Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","